  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABBell Bottom Blues - 40th Anniversary Version / 2010
    Remastered\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABLayla - 40th Anniversary Version / 2010
    Remastered\xBB y \xABHave You Ever Loved A Woman? - 40th Anniversary Version
    / 2010 Remastered\xBB."
